{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/00e07f3416068d704477a3264913d6f9.avif?t=1768114624\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras_big/00e07f3416068d704477a3264913d6f9.avif?t=1768114624 width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORLD IS QUIET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cities are gone. The noise has stopped. In <strong><i>Still Alive: Hollowed Horizon</i></strong>, you step into a world where nature has taken over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2055, but it feels like ancient history. The golden age of humanity is buried under vines, moss, and water. You are a lone survivor on a journey across a vast, dangerous wilderness. There is no one to hold your hand. The only way forward is through the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/4da3d452654e3f57ac63fe196d330675.poster.avif?t=1768114624\" aria-label=\"Steam-Cave-GIF1\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/4da3d452654e3f57ac63fe196d330675.webm?t=1768114624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/4da3d452654e3f57ac63fe196d330675.mp4?t=1768114624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE YOUR OWN PATH</strong> The road is broken, so you must find a new one. Climb steep cliffs, swim across flooding rivers, and navigate deep forests. The terrain is your biggest obstacle. Manage your stamina and choose your route carefully, one slip could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A BEAUTIFUL WORLD</strong> Explore a map that tells a story without words. From the tops of wind-swept mountains to the dark tunnels of sunken subways, every location is a puzzle to solve. The world is beautiful, but it does not care if you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE PAST</strong> Why did the world fall silent? Use your scanner to find what was left behind. Locate hidden supplies, read the final messages of the people who lived here, and piece together the mystery of the plague. The truth is buried under the ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE UNKNOWN</strong> You are mostly alone, but you are not safe. The weather can change in an instant, and the nights are dangerous. There are things living in the dark that have changed just like the world has. Use stealth and wit to stay alive, fighting is not always the answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/1475c6a30c9fb8f88d9ea8f68118bacb.poster.avif?t=1768114624\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/1475c6a30c9fb8f88d9ea8f68118bacb.webm?t=1768114624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/1475c6a30c9fb8f88d9ea8f68118bacb.mp4?t=1768114624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A SURVIVOR WITH NO PAST</strong> You play as Haunt Cross. He believes he is the last human left on Earth. But survival is not his only burden. As you trek through the wilderness, you will find that the ruins hold more than just supplies. They hold memories. The further you travel, the more you will learn about the man you are playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE WORLD REMEMBERS</strong> The story is not told in long cutscenes. It is written on the walls, hidden in old data logs, and buried in the ashes you walk through. To understand what happened to the world, you must stop and look. Every abandoned camp and overgrown house has a secret to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ALONE WITH THE ECHOES</strong> There is no one to talk to. The isolation is real. In the quiet moments between the storms, you will face the hardest question of all: hidden in this vast, empty world, who was Haunt Cross before the silence fell?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/132790151e0462e657cd3ed9da81cbee.poster.avif?t=1768114624\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/132790151e0462e657cd3ed9da81cbee.webm?t=1768114624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/extras/132790151e0462e657cd3ed9da81cbee.mp4?t=1768114624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nature has won. Humanity is a memory.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find the truth, or will you <i>become part of the ruins?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3869750?t=1768114624","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/67e866b9418e0fc4493f6be4d292f13eea1bed2f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768114624","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869750/cc345a2dbb2a8109432685084cbf4af5e2443a82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768114624","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a